RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20220726T080000
CREATED:20160722T213726Z
DESCRIPTION:This is an informal bi-weekly meeting discussing current progre
 ss\, issues and challenges of the C++ modules implementation. We started in
  2017 where we were only two people Richard and I mostly discussing modules
 -related issues in the context of incremental C++. Since then the group of 
 people has expanded covering broader participation and C++ modules topics i
 n both Clang\, GCC and MSVC.\n\nWe thought that the community should know a
 bout this and we would like to welcome people contributing in the ongoing C
 ++ modules work to join.\n\nThe group objectives have been:\n\n    * Accele
 rate the review of patches\n    * Clarify implementation decisions\n    * D
 iscuss clang/gcc/msvc compliance\n    * Gather early implementability feedb
 ack about Modules-related ideas for improvements\n    * Investigate integra
 tion with build systems (cmake\, build2\, etc).\n    * Share implementation
 \, usage and troubleshooting experience\n\nAttendees are required to adhere
  to the LLVM Code of Conduct\n(https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html). F
 or any Code of Conduct reports\,\nplease contact the organizers\, and also 
 email conduct@llvm.org.\n\nOrganizer(s): Vassil Vassilev (vgvassilev@gmail.
 com)\n\ndiscord-bot-channels-to-mention: #clang\ndiscord-bot-event-type: sy
 nc-up\ndiscord-bot-mention: @vvassilev\ndiscord-bot-message: Come join us t
 o chat about C++ Modules!\ndiscord-bot-reminder-time-before-start: 30\n\nÜb
 er Google Meet teilnehmen: https://meet.google.com/csc-umsp-zgc\nOder telef
 onisch: (US) +1 863-888-2683 PIN: 551991#\nWeitere Telefonnummern: https://
 tel.meet/csc-umsp-zgc?pin=8597885723338&hs=7\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Me
 et: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20250401T165718Z
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Modules discussion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
