DESCRIPTION:We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.\n\nDate: 
 Monday Feb 16\, 2025 6pm\nEvent Address: Don Giovanni’s 235 Castro St\, Mou
 ntain View\, CA 94041\n\nThere is no need to RSVP for this event. There wil
 l still be a cash bar.\n\nWhile “The State of California has announced that
  the COVID-19 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folk
 s are still encouraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to att
 end).\n\nWe’ll be indoors\; consider bringing a mask.\n\nAttendees are requ
 ired to adhere to the LLVM Community Code of Conduct . For any Code of Cond
 uct reports\, please contact the organizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.o
 rg<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\n\nOrganizer(s):\n\nSharjeel Khan sharjeelkhan
 @google.com<mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com>\n\nMatthias Braun matthiasb@met
 a.com<mailto:matthiasb@meta.com>\n\nNick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com
 <mailto:ndesaulniers@tesla.com>\n\nBig thanks to Google who will be providi
 ng the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to help fund th
 ese events\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to sponsor th
 is event in the future.\n\n________________________________________________
 ________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJoin: https://te
 ams.microsoft.com/meet/2604353851754?p=rrhPFY7JOr38jcDJ2W\nMeeting ID: 260 
 435 385 175 4\nPasscode: js6x3BK2\n________________________________\nNeed h
 elp?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US> | System reference<https:/
 /teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MzI5MzQ4ZDAtNmJmNS00MDUxLWE
 xMTMtMWZjZGNmNmM3OTcw%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%229026c5f4-86d0
 -4b9f-bd39-b7d4d0fb4674%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%226dc7615e-3025-4c7a-b998-734b2ca
 5589c%22%7d>\nFor organizers: Meeting options<https://teams.microsoft.com/m
 eetingOptions/?organizerId=6dc7615e-3025-4c7a-b998-734b2ca5589c&tenantId=90
 26c5f4-86d0-4b9f-bd39-b7d4d0fb4674&threadId=19_meeting_MzI5MzQ4ZDAtNmJmNS00
 MDUxLWExMTMtMWZjZGNmNmM3OTcw@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US>\n_______
