 \, we're moving the meeting to Teams (link below) to allow the meeting dura
 tion to exceed the "free"-tier Google limits and enable notetaking assistan
 ce.</p><p> Weekly LLVM WG-HLSL meeting to discuss implementation details fo
 r HLSL in LLVM &amp\; Clang. </p><p>Agendas will be posted as a PR on  <a h
 ref="https://github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl/pulls">https://github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl
 /pulls</a></p><p> Meeting minutes will be stored on GitHub  <a href="https:
 //github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl/tree/main/meetings">https://github.com/llvm/wg-hl
 sl/tree/main/meetings</a></p><p>-Chris</p><p>______________________________
 __________________________________________________</p><p><b>Microsoft Teams
  meeting</b> <a href="https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US">Need help
 ?</a></p><p>Join:  <a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/2573414736045?
 p=oFVQHEKjfedybeTuQ9">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/2573414736045?p=oFVQ
 HEKjfedybeTuQ9</a> </p><p>Meeting ID: 257 341 473 604 5</p><p>Passcode: h2W
 7v2n6</p><p> </p><p>Dial in by phone</p><p><a>+1 323-849-4874\,\,530451863#
 </a> United States\, Los Angeles</p><p><a href="https://dialin.teams.micros
 oft.com/8551f4c1-bea3-441a-8738-69aa517a91c5?id=530451863">Find a local num
 ber</a></p><p>Phone conference ID: 530 451 863#</p><p>For organizers: <a hr
