DESCRIPTION:<p>We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.</p><p>
 Date: Monday Oct 26\, 2025 6pm<br>Event Address: <a href="https://goo.gl/ma
 ps/4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9">Don Giovanni’s </a>235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA
  94041</p><p>There is no need to RSVP for this event. There will still be a
  cash bar.</p><p>We’ll be <em>indoors</em>\; consider bringing hearing prot
 ection.</p><p>Attendees are required to adhere to the <a href="https://llvm
 .org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html">LLVM Community Code of Conduct </a>. For any 
 Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organizers\, and also email <a
  href="mailto:conduct@llvm.org">conduct@llvm.org</a>.</p><p>Organizer(s):</
 p><ul><li><p>Sharjeel Khan <a href="mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com">sharjee
 lkhan@google.com</a></p></li><li><p>Matthias Braun <a href="mailto:matthias
 b@meta.com">matthiasb@meta.com</a></p></li><li><p>Nick Desaulniers <a href=
 "https://ndesaulniers@google.com/">ndesaulniers@google.com</a></p></li></ul
 ><p>Big thanks to <a href="https://careers.google.com/">Google</a> who will
  be providing the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to h
 elp fund these events\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to
  sponsor this event in the future.</p>
