DESCRIPTION:We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.\nDate: Mo
 nday Jun 23\, 2025 6pm\nEvent Address: Don Giovanni’s <https://goo.gl/maps/
 4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9> 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\nThere is no ne
 ed to RSVP for this event. There will still be a cash bar.\nWhile “The Stat
 e of California has announced <https://www.santaclaraca.gov/i-want-to/stay-
 informed/covid-19-county-and-state-public-health-orders> that the COVID-19 
 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are still en
 couraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to attend).\nWe’ll b
 e outdoors\; consider bringing a jacket.\nAttendees are required to adhere 
 to the LLVM Community Code of Conduct <https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.
 html> . For any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organizers\, a
 nd also email conduct@llvm.org<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\nOrganizer(s):\n\n
   *   Sharjeel Khan sharjeelkhan@google.com<mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com>
 \n  *   Matthias Braun matthiasb@meta.com<mailto:matthiasb@meta.com>\n  *  
  Nick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com<mailto:ndesaulniers@tesla.com>\n\n
 Big thanks to Google<https://careers.google.com/> who will be providing the
  sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to help fund these ev
 ents\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to sponsor this eve
 nt in the future.\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20250617T172415Z
