DESCRIPTION:Autovectorization is one of the most important performance opti
 mizations for performance sensitive workloads. Let’s catch up in a monthly 
 sync up to improve autovectorization of both loops and straight line code.\
 n\n\nThis event is a meetup for all contributors to LLVM’s Autovectorizer.\
 n\n\nAttendees are required to adhere to the LLVM Code of Conduct\n\n(https
 ://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html). For any Code of Conduct reports\,\n\n
 please contact the organizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org.\n\n\nOrgan
 izer(s): Aditya Kumar(hiraditya@msn.com)\nFlorian Hahn (flo@fhahn.com)\n\nG
 oogle meet link: meet.google.com/der-tymo-xye\n\nGoogle doc link(this is wo
