 ID-19 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are st
 ill encouraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to attend).\n\
 nWe’ll be indoors\; consider bringing a mask.\n\nAttendees are required to 
 adhere to the LLVM Community Code of Conduct <https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfC
 onduct.html> . For any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organiz
 ers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\n\nOrganize
 r(s):\n·         Stephen Hines srhines@google.com<mailto:srhines@google.com
