 ·         Nick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com<mailto:ndesaulniers@tesla
 .com>\n\nBig thanks to Google<https://careers.google.com/> who will be prov
 iding the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to help fund
  these events\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to sponsor
  this event in the future.\n\n\n___________________________________________
