DESCRIPTION:We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.\n\nDate: 
 Monday Oct 27\, 2025 6pm\nEvent Address: Don Giovanni’s 235 Castro St\, Mou
 ntain View\, CA 94041\n\nThere is no need to RSVP for this event. There wil
 l still be a cash bar.\n\nWhile “The State of California has announced that
  the COVID-19 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folk
 s are still encouraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to att
 end).\n\nWe’ll be indoors\; consider bringing a mask. Note that the circus 
 will be in town.\n\nAttendees are required to adhere to the LLVM Community 
 Code of Conduct . For any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the orga
 nizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\n\nOrgan
 izer(s):\n\nSharjeel Kham sharjeelkhan@google.com<mailto:sharjeelkhan@googl
 e.com>\n\nMatthias Braun matthiasb@meta.com<mailto:matthiasb@meta.com>\n\nN
 ick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com<mailto:ndesaulniers@tesla.com>\n\nBi
 g thanks to Google who will be providing the sponsorship for this event. If
  your employer is able to help fund these events\, please reach out to the 
