UID:6gs74otopc4lncun906b2qgjtq@google.com
CREATED:20260604T201629Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://discourse.llvm.org/t/llvm-bay-area-monthly-mee
 tup-mon-jun-8-26-6pm/90985">https://discourse.llvm.org/t/llvm-bay-area-mont
 hly-meetup-mon-jun-8-26-6pm/90985</a><br><br><p>We’re planning the next LLV
 M Bay Area monthly meetup.</p><p>Date: Monday Jun 8\, 2025 6pm<br>Event Add
 ress: <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9">Don Giovanni’s </a>23
 5 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041</p><p>There is no need to RSVP for t
 his event. There will still be a cash bar.</p><p>While “The State of Califo
 rnia has <a href="https://www.santaclaraca.gov/i-want-to/stay-informed/covi
 d-19-county-and-state-public-health-orders">announced </a>that the COVID-19
  State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are still e
 ncouraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to attend).</p><p>W
 e’ll be outdoors\; consider bringing a jacket.</p><p>Attendees are required
  to adhere to the <a href="https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html">LLVM C
 ommunity Code of Conduct </a>. For any Code of Conduct reports\, please con
 tact the organizers\, and also email <a href="mailto:conduct@llvm.org">cond
 uct@llvm.org</a>.</p><p>Organizer(s):</p><ul><li><p>Sharjeel Khan <a href="
 mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com">sharjeelkhan@google.com</a></p></li><li><p>
 Matthias Braun <a href="mailto:matthiasb@meta.com">matthiasb@meta.com</a></
 p></li><li><p>Nick Desaulniers <a href="https://ndesaulniers@google.com/">n
 desaulniers@google.com</a></p></li></ul><p>Big thanks to <a href="https://c
 areers.google.com/">Google</a> who will be providing the sponsorship for th
 is event. If your employer is able to help fund these events\, please reach
  out to the organizers about helping to sponsor this event in the future.</
 p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260605T162634Z
LOCATION:Don Giovanni\, 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LLVM Bay Area Monthly Meetup (Mon Jun 8 ‘26 6pm)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
