 entin dot colombet at gmail dot com)<br><html-blob><br></html-blob><br><htm
 l-blob>Topics include but are not limited to general questions on:<br>- How
  to contribute to LLVM/MLIR.<br>- Instruction selection (GlobalISel/<span>S
 DISel)</span></html-blob><br><html-blob>- Codegen<br>- Machine IR<br>- Regi
 ster allocation<br>- LLVM IR<br>- LLVM backends (in particular AArch64\, AR
 M\, X86)<br>- LLVM optimizations<br><br>And to some extend:<br>- Machine Sc
 heduler<br>- MCA<br>- RISC-V</html-blob>\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: ht
 tps://meet.google.com/cbz-grrp-obs\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Meet: https:
 //support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
