DESCRIPTION:This is a meeting to discuss ongoing work for the ClangIR upstr
 eaming effort. A standard agenda will be used for every meeting. Minutes wi
 ll not be published regularly\, but comments may be posted to the ClangIR D
 iscord channel as necessary to publicize any issues discussed. This meeting
  is open to anyone who wishes to be involved in the upstreaming effort\, ev
 en if just to follow the status.<br><br>Attendees are required to adhere to
  the LLVM Code of Conduct (<a href="https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.htm
 l).">https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html).</a> For any Code of Conduct
  reports\, please contact the organizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org.
 <br><br><b>----------<br>Agenda</b><br><b>----------</b><br>- Opens<br>- Di
 scuss any blocking issues<br>- Update on current work<br>- Discuss plans fo
 r upcoming work<br><br>Organizer: Andy Kaylor (akaylor@nvidia.com)<br><br>d
 iscord-bot-channels-to-mention: #clangir<br>discord-bot-event-type: sync-up
 <br>discord-bot-mention: @andykaylor<br>discord-bot-message: Come join us t
 o discuss ClangIR upstreaming!<br>discord-bot-reminder-time-before-start: 3
 0\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: https://meet.google.com/gzh-rdxv-vpc\nOde
 r telefonisch: (US) +1 803-999-5429 PIN: 819713237#\nWeitere Telefonnummern
 : https://tel.meet/gzh-rdxv-vpc?pin=8508023445741&hs=7\n\nWeitere Informati
 onen zu Meet: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20260321T205547Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ClangIR Upstreaming Coordination Meeting
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
