DESCRIPTION:We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.\n\nDate: 
 Monday Jul 21\, 2025 6pm\nEvent Address: Don Giovanni’s <https://goo.gl/map
 s/4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9> 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\n\nThere is n
 o need to RSVP for this event. There will still be a cash bar.\n\nWhile “Th
 e State of California has announced <https://www.santaclaraca.gov/i-want-to
 /stay-informed/covid-19-county-and-state-public-health-orders> that the COV
 ID-19 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are st
 ill encouraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to attend).\n\
 nWe’ll be outdoors\; consider bringing a jacket.\n\nAttendees are required 
 to adhere to the LLVM Community Code of Conduct <https://llvm.org/docs/Code
 OfConduct.html> . For any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the orga
 nizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\n\nOrgan
 izer(s):\n·         Stephen Hines srhines@google.com<mailto:srhines@google.
 com>\n·         Matthias Braun matthiasb@meta.com<mailto:matthiasb@meta.com
 >\n·         Nick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com<mailto:ndesaulniers@te
 sla.com>\n\nBig thanks to Meta<https://www.metacareers.com/jobs/?q=compiler
 > who will be providing the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is
  able to help fund these events\, please reach out to the organizers about 
 helping to sponsor this event in the future.\n\n\n_________________________
