DESCRIPTION:Autovectorization is one of the most important performance opti
 mizations for performance sensitive workloads. Let’s catch up in a monthly 
 sync up to improve autovectorization of both loops and straight line code.\
 n\n\nThis event is a meetup for all contributors to LLVM’s Autovectorizer.\
 n\n\nAttendees are required to adhere to the LLVM Code of Conduct\n\n(https
 ://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html). For any Code of Conduct reports\,\n\n
 please contact the organizers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org.\n\n\nOrgan
 izer(s): Aditya Kumar(hiraditya@msn.com)\nFlorian Hahn (flo@fhahn.com)\n\nG
 oogle meet link: meet.google.com/der-tymo-xye\n\nGoogle doc link(this is wo
 rld editable): https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Glzy2JiWuysbD-HBWGUOkZqT
 09GJ4_Ljodr0lXD5XfQ/edit?usp=sharing\n\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: http
 s://meet.google.com/der-tymo-xye\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Meet: https://
 support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20260316T140517Z
SEQUENCE:1011
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Vectorizer Improvements
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260319T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260319T123000
DTSTAMP:20261027T013714Z
UID:82ltu1rjpf8csk46e1729oobc7_R20251120T173000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Chicago:20260319T113000
CREATED:20220328T201738Z
DESCRIPTION:Meeting organizer is Chris Bieneman &lt\;<a href="mailto:chris.
 bieneman@me.com" target="_blank">chris.bieneman@me.com</a>&gt\;\, beanz on 
 Discord and Discourse. If you would prefer a direct Outlook invite please r
 each out to me directly.<br><p>As discussed in the 7/3 meeting we're adjust
 ing the format and frequency to use this time for more direct engineering c
 ollaboration.<br><br>With the format change and the longer meeting duration
 \, we're moving the meeting to Teams (link below) to allow the meeting dura
 tion to exceed the "free"-tier Google limits and enable notetaking assistan
 ce.</p><p> Weekly LLVM WG-HLSL meeting to discuss implementation details fo
 r HLSL in LLVM &amp\; Clang. </p><p>Agendas will be posted as a PR on  <a h
 ref="https://github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl/pulls">https://github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl
 /pulls</a></p><p> Meeting minutes will be stored on GitHub  <a href="https:
 //github.com/llvm/wg-hlsl/tree/main/meetings">https://github.com/llvm/wg-hl
 sl/tree/main/meetings</a></p><p>-Chris</p><p>______________________________
 __________________________________________________</p><p><b>Microsoft Teams
