UID:22bb82et52fh42et2gni5ko4h0@google.com
CREATED:20260414T204228Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.</p><p>
 Date: Monday Apr 27\, 2025 6pm<br>Event Address: <a href="https://goo.gl/ma
 ps/4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9">Don Giovanni’s </a>235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA
  94041</p><p>There is no need to RSVP for this event. There will still be a
  cash bar.</p><p>While “The State of California has <a href="https://www.sa
 ntaclaraca.gov/i-want-to/stay-informed/covid-19-county-and-state-public-hea
 lth-orders">announced </a>that the COVID-19 State of Emergency has ended as
  of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are still encouraged to wear a masks (thoug
 h they are not required to attend).</p><p>We’ll be outdoors\; consider brin
 ging a jacket.</p><p>Attendees are required to adhere to the <a href="https
 ://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html">LLVM Community Code of Conduct </a>. F
 or any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organizers\, and also e
 mail <a href="mailto:conduct@llvm.org">conduct@llvm.org</a>.</p><p>Organize
 r(s):</p><ul><li><p>Sharjeel Khan <a href="mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com">
 sharjeelkhan@google.com</a></p></li><li><p>Matthias Braun <a href="mailto:m
 atthiasb@meta.com">matthiasb@meta.com</a></p></li><li><p>Nick Desaulniers<a
  href="https://ndesaulniers@google.com/"> ndesaulniers@google.com</a></p></
 li></ul><p>Big thanks to <a href="https://careers.google.com/">Google</a> w
 ho will be providing the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is ab
 le to help fund these events\, please reach out to the organizers about hel
 ping to sponsor this event in the future.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T215839Z
LOCATION:Don Giovanni\, 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LLVM Bay Area Monthly Meetup (Mon Apr 27 ‘26 6pm)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
