DESCRIPTION:<p>We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.</p><p>
 Date: Monday Sep 14\, 2025 6pm<br>Event Address: <a href="https://goo.gl/ma
 ps/4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9">Don Giovanni’s </a>235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA
  94041</p><p>There is no need to RSVP for this event. There will still be a
  cash bar.</p><p>We’ll be outdoors\; consider bringing a jacket.</p><p>Atte
 ndees are required to adhere to the <a href="https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfCo
 nduct.html">LLVM Community Code of Conduct </a>. For any Code of Conduct re
 ports\, please contact the organizers\, and also email <a href="mailto:cond
 uct@llvm.org">conduct@llvm.org</a>.</p><p>Organizer(s):</p><ul><li><p>Sharj
 eel Khan <a href="mailto:sharjeelkhan@google.com">sharjeelkhan@google.com</
 a></p></li><li><p>Matthias Braun <a href="mailto:matthiasb@meta.com">matthi
 asb@meta.com</a></p></li><li><p>Nick Desaulniers <a href="https://ndesaulni
 ers@google.com/">ndesaulniers@google.com</a></p></li></ul><p>Big thanks to 
 <a href="https://www.metacareers.com/jobs/?q=compiler">Meta</a> who will be
  providing the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to help
  fund these events\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to sp
 onsor this event in the future.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T200342Z
LOCATION:Don Giovanni\, 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\, USA
