UID:17hge0qhhl73c0ohpc4n55cedd@google.com
CREATED:20260122T114712Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>In March we welcome Valentin Churavy to talk about the Ju
 lia frontend for LLVM.</span><br><br><span>Valentin is a long-term contribu
 tor to JuliaLang\, JuliaGPU and EnzymeAD. He is a Research Software Enginee
 r at JGU and Uni Augsburg\, and graduated from MIT where he did his doctora
 te in the JuliaLab.</span><br><br><span>Julia is a high-level dynamic progr
 amming language that is widely used in technical computing. Let's explore h
 ow Julia uses LLVM to target CPUs\, accelerators and even synthesize gradie
 nts.</span><br><span> </span><br>How to find us: Go through the gate on Run
 gestr. 20 and straight to the 2. courtyard (not the riverside!). Find the g
 reen door on the right of the courtyard\, ring and go up to the 2rd floor. 
 In case you know: it's right above c-base<br><br>More RSVPs: <a href="https
 ://www.meetup.com/llvm-social-berlin/events/313170842/" target="_blank">htt
 ps://www.meetup.com/llvm-social-berlin/events/313170842/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260210T152842Z
LOCATION:Rungestraße 20\, 10179 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LLVM Meetup Berlin (Germany)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
