DESCRIPTION:\nThis is the invitation to the Classic Flang Technical Call.\n
 \nParticipants are usually from companies/labs involved in the Classic Flan
 g project\, members of Linux distributions\, and users of Classic Flang. Th
 e call happens every other Wednesday in the same week as the LLVM Flang tec
 hnical call.\n\nThe primary agenda of the meeting is to discuss the Classic
  Flang project (https://github.com/flang-compiler/flang). Agenda and minute
 s are shared in a Google Doc (https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-OuiKx4d7
 O6eLEJDBDKSRnSiUO2rgRR-c2Ga4AkrzOI/edit).\n\n\n____________________________
