 3s\nDownload Teams<https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-teams/download
 -app> | Join on the web<https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-teams/join-a-me
 eting>\nJoin with a video conferencing device\n831027220@t.plcm.vc\nVideo C
 onference ID: 113 837 959 5\nAlternate VTC instructions<https://dialin.plcm
 .vc/teams/?key=831027220&conf=1138379595>\nLearn More<https://aka.ms/JoinTe
 amsMeeting> | Meeting options<https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?o
 rganizerId=d5724e89-a25b-4595-b660-ba2e5d968db0&tenantId=3dd8961f-e488-4e60
 -8e11-a82d994e183d&threadId=19_meeting_ZTgyNGZkYzQtMjY4Yy00ZTBmLTg3ODgtZWNm
