DESCRIPTION:We’re planning the next LLVM Bay Area monthly meetup.\nDate: Mo
 nday May 12\, 2025 6pm\nEvent Address: Don Giovanni’s <https://goo.gl/maps/
 4EmesZo6y7FowRcQ9> 235 Castro St\, Mountain View\, CA 94041\nThere is no ne
 ed to RSVP for this event. There will still be a cash bar.\nWhile “The Stat
 e of California has announced <https://www.santaclaraca.gov/i-want-to/stay-
 informed/covid-19-county-and-state-public-health-orders> that the COVID-19 
 State of Emergency has ended as of February 28\, 2023\,” folks are still en
 couraged to wear a masks (though they are not required to attend).\nWe’ll b
 e outdoors\; consider bringing a mask and a coat.\nAttendees are required t
 o adhere to the LLVM Community Code of Conduct <https://llvm.org/docs/CodeO
 fConduct.html> . For any Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organ
 izers\, and also email conduct@llvm.org<mailto:conduct@llvm.org>.\nOrganize
 r(s):\n\n  *   Stephen Hines srhines@google.com<mailto:srhines@google.com>\
 n  *   Matthias Braun matthiasb@meta.com<mailto:matthiasb@meta.com>\n  *   
 Nick Desaulniers ndesaulniers@tesla.com<mailto:ndesaulniers@tesla.com>\n\nB
 ig thanks to Meta<https://www.metacareers.com/jobs/?q=compiler> who will be
  providing the sponsorship for this event. If your employer is able to help
  fund these events\, please reach out to the organizers about helping to sp
 onsor this event in the future.\n\n\n______________________________________
 __________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need help?<http
 s://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US>\nJoin the meeting now<https://teams
 .microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NDYxMzMwNmItYjg4Mi00ZDFlLWIyNTYtN
 2RiODNkMzM2N2Ex%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%229026c5f4-86d0-4b9f-
 bd39-b7d4d0fb4674%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%226dc7615e-3025-4c7a-b998-734b2ca5589c%
 22%7d>\nMeeting ID: 227 276 730 997 3\nPasscode: d8oV72Gx\n________________
 ________________\nFor organizers: Meeting options<https://teams.microsoft.c
 om/meetingOptions/?organizerId=6dc7615e-3025-4c7a-b998-734b2ca5589c&tenantI
 d=9026c5f4-86d0-4b9f-bd39-b7d4d0fb4674&threadId=19_meeting_NDYxMzMwNmItYjg4
 Mi00ZDFlLWIyNTYtN2RiODNkMzM2N2Ex@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US>\n___
