BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261029T180000Z
DTEND:20261029T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261027T013714Z
UID:1sb5eetm7upom6jvnlgtj55br5@google.com
CREATED:20261019T085747Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Winter season kicks off with a presentation by <a href="http
 s://github.com/weliveindetail" target="_blank">Stefan Gränitz</a> on <b>LLV
 M backend plugins</b>. Stefan works as consultant and freelance developer\,
  supporting small/medium-sized companies to build and maintain LLVM-based t
 echnologies.</p><span><p>Earlier this year\, LLVM's plugin interface gained
  the <i>PreCodeGenCallback</i> hook. It allows us to inject code before the
  backend pipeline or even replace the entire backend with a custom implemen
 tation. In this session we will discuss opportunities and limitation of the
  feature and see how clients have been adopting it in past and ongoing rele
 ases.<br><span><br><b>How to find us:</b> Go through the gate on <a href="h
 ttps://maps.app.goo.gl/8yydMT1yZdQ8s3Qr9" target="_blank">Rungestr. 20</a> 
 and straight to the 2. courtyard (not the riverside!). Find the green door 
 on the right of the courtyard\, ring at LLVM and go up to the 2rd floor. In
  case you know: it's right above <a href="https://c-base.org/" target="_bla
 nk">c-base</a>.</span><br><br>Small snacks and drinks will be available. Th
 ere is always space for outside topics and discussions. If you have specifi
 c questions\, please bring them. Looking forward to meeting everyone again!
 <br><br>More RSVPs: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/llvm-social-berlin/even
 ts/317044886/">https://www.meetup.com/llvm-social-berlin/events/317044886/<
 /a></p></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T051547Z
LOCATION:Rungestraße 20\, 10179 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LLVM Meetup Berlin (Germany)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
