DESCRIPTION:<pre>This event is an additional meeting to the monthly sync-up
  for the LLVM Qualification Group (EU/Asia-friendly). The purpose is to dis
 cuss and solve comments on the slides for the US LLVM Devs Meeting.</pre><p
 re>Attendees are required to adhere to the LLVM Qualification WG Code of Co
 nduct (<a href="https://llvm.org/docs/QualGroup.html" target="_blank"><u><u
 >https://llvm.org/docs/<u></u>QualGroup.html</u></u></a>).</pre><pre>For an
 y Code of Conduct reports\, please contact the organizers\, and also email 
 <a href="mailto:conduct@llvm.org" target="_blank"><u><u>conduct@llvm.org</u
 ></u></a>.</pre><pre>Agenda/Meeting Minutes: <a href="https://discourse.llv
 m.org/t/llvm-qualification-wg-sync-ups-meeting-minutes/87148" target="_blan
 k"><u><u>https://discourse.llvm.org/t/<u></u>llvm-qualification-wg-sync-<u>
 </u>ups-meeting-minutes/87148</u></u></a></pre><pre>Organ<u></u>izer: Wendi
  Urribarri (<a href="mailto:uwendi@gmail.com" target="_blank">uwendi@gmail.
 com</a><span>) </span></pre><pre><pre>discord-bot-channels-to-<u></u>mentio
 n: #fusa-qual-wg</pre><pre>discord-bot-event-type: sync-up</pre><pre>discor
 d-bot-mention: @uwendi</pre><pre>discord-bot-message: Come join us to the L
 LVM Qualification WG sync-up meeting dedicated to the preparation of our ta
 lk at the US LLVM Developers' Meeting.</pre><pre>discord-bot-reminder-time-
 <u></u>before-start: 60</pre></pre>\n\nÜber Google Meet teilnehmen: https:/
 /meet.google.com/hyh-rhrm-yvh\nOder telefonisch: (JP) +81 3-4545-0450 PIN: 
 3731791466377#\nWeitere Telefonnummern: https://tel.meet/hyh-rhrm-yvh?pin=3
 731791466377&hs=7\n\nWeitere Informationen zu Meet: https://support.google.
 com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T222035Z
