RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/London:20250410T160000
CREATED:20190620T145032Z
DESCRIPTION:<u></u>This event is a meetup for all developers of RISC-V LLVM
 . Meeting agendas are posted on discourse before the event.<br><br>Attendee
 s are required to adhere to the LLVM Code of Conduct<br>(<a href="https://l
 lvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html).">https://llvm.org/docs/CodeOfConduct.html
 ).</a> For any Code of Conduct reports\,<br>please contact the organizers\,
  and also email <a href="mailto:conduct@llvm.org">conduct@llvm.org</a>.<br>
